WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.973 --> 00:00:13.714
Bello, we’re going to go now.

2
00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:16.016
Brad: It’s been nice meeting you.

3
00:00:16.036 --> 00:00:19.497
Tina: Your daddy will be home soon, okay?

4
00:00:20.278 --> 00:00:22.119
You stay here and wait for him.

5
00:00:22.579 --> 00:00:29.243
Bello: Bye-bye.

6
00:00:29.263 --> 00:00:30.964
Tina: Bye, Bello.

7
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.642
Brad: Well, let’s follow the little bug home.

8
00:00:34.662 --> 00:00:37.264
Danny: Okay, bug, show us the way.

9
00:00:44.029 --> 00:00:46.511
Going home now doesn’t feel very heroic.

10
00:00:46.531 --> 00:00:50.253
Tina: That’s because we’re not acting like heroes.

11
00:00:50.273 --> 00:00:52.595
Brad: Why do you say that?

12
00:00:52.615 --> 00:00:54.977
Tina: We didn’t complete our mission.

13
00:00:54.997 --> 00:00:56.958
Danny: I don’t know.

14
00:00:57.699 --> 00:00:58.880
Maybe we did enough.

15
00:01:01.312 --> 00:01:03.393
Danny: This is not a happy place.

16
00:01:04.194 --> 00:01:06.015
Brad: Geez, look at the sun.

17
00:01:06.676 --> 00:01:07.877
It’s almost black.

18
00:01:07.897 --> 00:01:12.320
Tina: This place would be less gloomy if the sun were shining.

19
00:01:19.925 --> 00:01:21.966
It’s the same door as last time.

20
00:01:21.986 --> 00:01:24.028
Tina: I don’t like the look of it.

21
00:01:24.048 --> 00:01:26.729
Danny: Hopian said we should go.

22
00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:28.671
We have to trust him.

23
00:01:28.691 --> 00:01:30.212
Tina: You first!

24
00:01:31.564 --> 00:01:32.305
Danny: Fine.

25
00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:33.145
I’m not scared.

26
00:01:33.165 --> 00:01:38.209
Tina: Maybe you are a little scared.

27
00:01:38.229 --> 00:01:42.812
Danny: No!

28
00:01:42.892 --> 00:01:45.013
Brad: Danny, what have you done!

29
00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:48.996
Tina: You squashed Hopian’s messenger bug!

30
00:01:49.016 --> 00:01:50.297
Danny: No!

31
00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.779
That is Hopian’s messenger bug!

32
00:01:53.699 --> 00:01:56.902
Brad: Then who sent the gray bug?

33
00:01:56.922 --> 00:01:59.603
Tina: It was a trap after all!

34
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:02.801
Tristay: Nooo!

35
00:02:03.361 --> 00:02:05.323
Those kids were almost gone for good.

36
00:02:05.343 --> 00:02:08.646
Tristay: Hopian, this is all your fault!

37
00:02:08.666 --> 00:02:11.228
Hopian: I don’t know what you mean.

38
00:02:11.248 --> 00:02:14.350
Tristay: You sent that red bug to warn them.

39
00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.392
Hopian: And what if I did?

40
00:02:16.452 --> 00:02:21.316
Tristay: You won’t try anything like that again after I punish you.

41
00:02:21.336 --> 00:02:24.599
Hopian: There’s nothing you can do to hurt me.

42
00:02:24.619 --> 00:02:26.980
Tristay: Oh yes, there is.

43
00:02:28.402 --> 00:02:29.382
Go get Hopian’s son!

44
00:02:29.402 --> 00:02:30.904
Hopian: No!

45
00:02:33.792 --> 00:02:37.334
Brad: I have a feeling that strange door didn’t lead back home.

46
00:02:37.354 --> 00:02:38.995
Danny: Home!

47
00:02:39.375 --> 00:02:41.437
We left Bello all alone at home!

48
00:02:41.457 --> 00:02:43.658
Tina: We have to get there quickly.

49
00:02:43.678 --> 00:02:46.420
Danny: Do you think Bello is safe?

50
00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:49.181
Brad: Tristay captured Hopian.

51
00:02:49.822 --> 00:02:51.803
He might try to capture Bello too.

52
00:02:51.823 --> 00:02:54.344
Tina: We have to run faster!

53
00:02:54.364 --> 00:02:59.167
All three: Bello!

54
00:02:59.627 --> 00:03:03.605
Bello! Tina: Come over here!

55
00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:05.288
The back door is open!

56
00:03:05.308 --> 00:03:07.793
Danny: We’re too late!

57
00:03:08.654 --> 00:03:09.115
Bello: Help!
